<title>SINGAPORE: United Overseas 1996 profit up 8.1 pct.</title>
<headline>United Overseas 1996 profit up 8.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
